              Holding a Bachelor's degree in Early Childhood Education with Music Education, Patricia brings developmental awareness to her violin teaching that many purely conservatory-trained teachers lack. She understands that a six-year-old learning to hold a bow needs different explanations, pacing, and encouragement than a ten-year-old tackling shifting into third position.
            </p>
