                <p class="text-base-600 text-sm">Every child progresses differently on the violin, and Patricia respects this. She adjusts lesson content and exam timelines based on each student's physical development, practice consistency, and musical maturity. Rushing through grades produces shaky technique; Patricia's patient, individualised approach ensures students carry solid foundations into every exam and beyond.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
